"Login-Checkbox, Admin-, Frontend- und REST-Sperre, Projektname, Demodaten."
msgstr ""
"Kaxxa tal-login, imblukkar ta' wp-admin, frontend u REST, isem tal-proġett u "
"dejta demo."

#: includes/class-nda-admin.php:931
msgid "Einstellungen erfolgreich gespeichert."
msgstr "L-issettjar ġie maħżun b'suċċess."

#. translators: %d: number of demo signatures created
#: includes/class-nda-admin.php:940
#, php-format
