"Is-siġill tal-quċċata tal-katina ma jaqbilx mal-kontenut: l-għażla nbidlet "
"mingħajr iċ-ċavetta."

#. translators: 1: rows present, 2: rows recorded in the sealed tip
#: includes/class-nda-database.php:768
#, php-format
